    "/admin": {"source": "web/admin.html"},
    "/live": {"source": "runtime_pages/index.html"}
  },
  "assetRoots": ["web", "runtime_pages"],
  "notes": "Runtime manifest v9 loads a browser-local temporal context layer before canonical Chat request preparation. It attaches stable per-user-message local date, clock time, timezone, UTC offset, and daypart context without altering displayed message text; the stable timestamp reconstruction preserves next-turn prompt-prefix reuse. Google server configuration and Ice Dragon v14 behavior remain unchanged."
}
